{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "75449f6e-f6ab-87da-b898-a46143b33443",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T11:53:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:50:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. I'm calling about my bin. The trash barrel, I think, or is it the recycling one, the blue one. Anyway, it's gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gone as in missing after pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I put it out at the curb last night, I thought that was the rule, and this morning the truck came, and now there's no bin. Not on the curb, not down the street. I looked up toward the avenue and everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "442 Spring Street. Fifth Ward, you know, up from the boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 442 Spring. And is it the trash barrel or the recycling bin that's missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, the green one? Is the green one trash? I always mix that up. It has the lid with the little flap."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't see which is which from here, but if it's the one with the flap you use for regular household trash, I'll note it as the trash barrel. Is the blue one still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:51:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The blue one's still here, in the garage. I didn't put that out. Was I supposed to put that out? Is it both every week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling usually runs on an alternating schedule from trash. Which is why I'd like to look up your pickup for you. Hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:52:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. Take your time. I'm just standing here at the window, looking at an empty curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:52:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Your trash is the weekly pickup, so the next one is next Wednesday. Recycling would be the Wednesday after that, so you're right to have held the blue one back today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so that's why. I thought it was every Wednesday, both of them. See, I get these things wrong. I check the price of eggs every week out of habit, but the trash schedule, forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:52:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, well, eggs are easier to track than the calendar. So for the missing barrel, I'll put in a request to have a replacement looked at, and a crew will check whether the truck took it or it walked off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So do I put anything out next Wednesday? With no barrel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Like, in a bag? Is a bag allowed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hopefully you'll have a replacement before then, but if not, call me back and we'll sort out the bag question. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0154. Good. Somebody will follow up with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the green is trash, and next Wednesday is trash again. And the blue is the one after. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Trash next Wednesday, recycling the week after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. I'll try to write that down this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:53:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
